  rights apply; read license-url. Frozen citation files under package/ record
  the preparation-time state and are retained unchanged.
type: software
title: "Continuity Instrument (CI): Evidence-Bound Measurement of Governed Continuity in Long-Lived AI Systems, v1.0 - English Academic Edition"
